---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /example-location-brief/
title: Example Location Briefs for San Francisco Businesses | Rofo
description: See how different San Francisco business needs lead to different locations worth investigating, reasons, and tradeoffs.
eleventyComputed:
  canonical: "{{ metadata.siteUrl }}/example-location-brief/"
---

<section class="sample-brief-hub">
  <div class="sample-brief-shell">
    {% set crumbs = [{ "label": "Rofo", "url": "/" }, { "label": "Example Location Briefs", "url": "/example-location-brief/" }] %}
    {% include "partials/breadcrumbs.njk" %}
    <header class="sample-brief-hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">San Francisco location intelligence</div>
      <h1>Example Location Briefs</h1>
      <p class="lead">See how different business needs lead Rofo to different locations worth investigating—and the tradeoffs worth understanding.</p>
      <p>Each example starts with a defined business profile and runs through Rofo's certified San Francisco recommendation logic. Your results will depend on your own business, team, access needs, and priorities.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/location-requirement/?journey=new&amp;city=San%20Francisco&amp;state=CA&amp;marketId=san-francisco&amp;source=example&amp;sourcePath=%2Fexample-location-brief%2F">See My Best-Fit Locations</a>
    </header>

    {% for group in ["Office", "Retail", "Industrial", "Flex"] %}
      <section class="sample-brief-group" aria-labelledby="sample-group-{{ group | lower }}">
        <div class="eyebrow">{{ group }}</div>
        <h2 id="sample-group-{{ group | lower }}">{{ group }} business decisions</h2>
        <div class="sample-brief-grid">
          {% for sample in sfPublicSampleBriefs.briefs %}{% if sample.group == group %}
            <a class="sample-brief-card" href="{{ sample.url }}">
              <h3>{{ sample.title }}</h3><p>{{ sample.description }}</p>
              <span>View example brief <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
            </a>
          {% endif %}{% endfor %}
        </div>
      </section>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
